 "phrases": [
  {
   "text": "This young engineer just built his very first bridge,",
   "s": 0.0,
   "e": 2.553
  },
  {
   "text": "and it stops six inches short.",
   "s": 2.753,
   "e": 4.075
  },
  {
   "text": "Not by mistake.",
   "s": 4.499,
   "e": 5.252
  },
  {
   "text": "He measured that gap twice.",
   "s": 5.558,
   "e": 6.905
  },
  {
   "text": "His boss turns purple.",
   "s": 7.35,
   "e": 8.502
  },
  {
   "text": "\"Did you run out of steel, boy?\"",
   "s": 8.867,
   "e": 10.174
  },
  {
   "text": "So the kid plugs the hole with two giant steel combs,",
   "s": 10.56,
   "e": 13.476
  },
  {
   "text": "their fingers sliding together.",
   "s": 13.673,
   "e": 14.892
  },
  {
   "text": "Next door, a rival company builds a flawless bridge.",
   "s": 15.463,
   "e": 18.142
  },
  {
   "text": "No gaps.",
   "s": 18.401,
   "e": 19.003
  },
  {
   "text": "Welded solid from cliff to cliff.",
   "s": 19.22,
   "e": 20.903
  },
  {
   "text": "It opens first,",
   "s": 21.358,
   "e": 22.125
  },
  {
   "text": "and fancy cars float across like butter.",
   "s": 22.264,
   "e": 24.111
  },
  {
   "text": "On the kid's bridge,",
   "s": 24.608,
   "e": 25.345
  },
  {
   "text": "every tire hits the comb.",
   "s": 25.558,
   "e": 26.789
  },
  {
   "text": "Ka-thunk!",
   "s": 27.115,
   "e": 27.733
  },
  {
   "text": "The newspaper gives it a nickname:",
   "s": 28.185,
   "e": 29.349
  },
  {
   "text": "\"The Ka-Thunk Bridge.\"",
   "s": 29.718,
   "e": 30.727
  },
  {
   "text": "Everyone takes the smooth one.",
   "s": 31.183,
   "e": 32.317
  },
  {
   "text": "But as spring turns to summer,",
   "s": 32.873,
   "e": 34.161
  },
  {
   "text": "something strange happens.",
   "s": 34.414,
   "e": 35.491
  },
  {
   "text": "The gap starts closing.",
   "s": 35.953,
   "e": 37.075
  },
  {
   "text": "A sandwich in April.",
   "s": 37.635,
   "e": 38.529
  },
  {
   "text": "A pencil in June.",
   "s": 38.891,
   "e": 39.782
  },
  {
   "text": "A coin in July.",
   "s": 40.162,
   "e": 41.141
  },
  {
   "text": "\"Look!\"",
   "s": 41.534,
   "e": 41.989
  },
  {
   "text": "the boss cheers.",
   "s": 42.143,
   "e": 42.873
  },
  {
   "text": "\"It finally fits!\"",
   "s": 43.049,
   "e": 44.093
  },
  {
   "text": "Then comes the hottest day of the year.",
   "s": 44.425,
   "e": 46.143
  },
  {
   "text": "One hundred fifteen degrees.",
   "s": 46.398,
   "e": 48.079
  },
  {
   "text": "The flawless bridge groans, and its middle bulges up like a giant speed bump.",
   "s": 48.456,
   "e": 52.193
  },
  {
   "text": "Cars launch off the top and land on their bumpers.",
   "s": 52.656,
   "e": 54.8
  },
  {
   "text": "You see,",
   "s": 55.259,
   "e": 55.566
  },
  {
   "text": "steel swells when it gets hot.",
   "s": 55.71,
   "e": 57.166
  },
  {
   "text": "On a long bridge, it can push out by several inches.",
   "s": 57.586,
   "e": 60.017
  },
  {
   "text": "The kid's combs gave the steel room to stretch.",
   "s": 60.431,
   "e": 62.562
  },
  {
   "text": "The welded bridge had nowhere to go,",
   "s": 62.944,
   "e": 64.318
  },
  {
   "text": "so it bent.",
   "s": 64.589,
   "e": 65.3
  },
  {
   "text": "By August,",
   "s": 65.731,
   "e": 66.265
  },
  {
   "text": "the line to cross the Ka-Thunk Bridge is a mile long.",
   "s": 66.423,
   "e": 68.907
  }
 ]
